<div class="card"><p>Schema updates preserve your configuration and uploaded files.</p><?php if($maintenance): ?><div class="notice error">Maintenance is active. If an upgrade failed, restore the database and application backup. Retrying partially applied changes is unsafe.</div><?php endif; ?>
